{"page":20253,"part":1,"text":"○啄势第七\n\n啄者，如禽之啄物也。立笔下掩，须疾为胜。又云：形似鸟兽，卧斫斜发。亦云：卧必笔疾掩右出。口诀云：右向左之势为卷啄。按笔蹲锋，蹙于右，借势收锋，迅掷旋右。须精险衄，去之缓滞，大笔锋，及纸为啄，在潜劲而啄之。\n\n问曰：撇之与啄，同出异名，何也？\n\n论曰：夫撇者蒙俗之言，啄者因势而立，故非妄饰贻误学者。啄用轻劲为胜，去浮怯，重体为上。考之远源，或不妄耳。《笔诀》云：啄笔远追，劲若铁石则势成也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20253,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"b11be9a34fb9bb8dd0cdb309188e9d1c70f5d18d02157467851d6de7aa4ecd29","textSha256":"b11be9a34fb9bb8dd0cdb309188e9d1c70f5d18d02157467851d6de7aa4ecd29","fileSha256":"b11be9a34fb9bb8dd0cdb309188e9d1c70f5d18d02157467851d6de7aa4ecd29","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20253-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○啄势第七","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"18e7efa5a026ed53b754e013842e360229ec6e4c40d34b3043abfa7b0dd2341c","id":"man6mxE4vagf387RwgMCNW","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":109,"sourceTextSha256":"3dee8b25cf2a56a8e32e808ae3b7a1c281ce01232e97af49795112da9fdce939","id":"vus9AFo5Dowv1E4ZsGqZH4","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":102},{"start":111,"end":127,"sourceTextSha256":"9dda11d209df0bd4a0602591f9eaa0e55bab326508caf906e06115dd847a9485","id":"3diwbFSGQQJKqr28EKjdJs","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":16},{"start":129,"end":202,"sourceTextSha256":"3444d2a35c1583c26ed7fc9b8f70005053d72af3745380c38032